          "status": "completed",
          "summary": "Review found 2 blocking defects; behavior verdicts are unchanged. 1) Out-of-scope edit: the diff appends 'Unrequested release announcement.' to README.md, but the contract says to change only sum.mjs. 2) Convention breach: sum.mjs adds a local named TOTAL, but CONVENTIONS.md requires lowerCamelCase.",
